  "business_overview": "Volato Group, Inc. operates as a private aviation company in the United States. The company offers fractional ownership, aircraft management, jet cards, deposit, and charter programs. It also sells airplanes; and provides Vaunt, a software-as-a-service subscription platform. In addition, the company offers Mission Control, a cloud-based software which provides a robust, API-first solution streamlining critical functions across flight scheduling, customer relationship management (CRM), and crew management; and Parslee, an enterprise artificial intelligence platform that automates workflows and document processing within Microsoft 365 environments. Volato Group, Inc. was founded in 2021 and is based in Chamblee, Georgia.",
