    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** The Vaunt membership platform is showing accelerating traction, with a sharp increase in paying members and a rapid shift toward recurring revenue, signaling strong product-market fit and growing demand for flexible private aviation access. However, this operational momentum is overshadowed by extreme market skepticism, as evidenced by an enormous surge in short interest during the quarter—a sign that a large segment of investors doubts the sustainability of the growth or the equity story, creating a highly contentious backdrop.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership has taken aggressive steps to derisk the financial structure, eliminating all convertible debt and slashing liabilities, which dramatically strengthens the balance sheet and removes a key overhang. The team is also advancing an AI-focused strategic direction and actively pursuing a potential merger to transform the business. While the operational pivot and capital discipline demonstrate intent, the extraordinary short interest suggests the market remains deeply unconvinced about management’s ability to deliver long-term value.",
